{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varvet/pundit/issues/548","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varvet/pundit","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varvet/pundit/issues/548/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varvet/pundit/issues/548/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varvet/pundit/issues/548/events","html_url":"https://github.com/varvet/pundit/issues/548","id":358051298,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzNTgwNTEyOTg=","number":548,"title":"Better Exception on #policy_scope","user":{"login":"nicolas-brousse","id":699216,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5OTIxNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/699216?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolas-brousse","html_url":"https://github.com/nicolas-brousse","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolas-brousse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolas-brousse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolas-brousse/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolas-brousse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolas-brousse/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolas-brousse/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolas-brousse/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolas-brousse/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolas-brousse/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":18320941,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxODMyMDk0MQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varvet/pundit/labels/problem","name":"problem","color":"fc2929","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2018-09-07T12:41:03Z","updated_at":"2018-10-02T11:18:50Z","closed_at":"2018-10-02T11:18:50Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hey.\r\n\r\nWe use `pundit` for a project and we've got an Exception which was confusing.\r\n\r\nSo we have a Policy with a Scope. And in the scope we did something wrong on a query. The query thrown an exception, and it was an ArgumentError too. But pundit catch it and returned an other exception who wasn't really linked to.\r\n\r\nI guess the [`#policy_scope`](https://github.com/varvet/pundit/blob/f6bf57b1b69eb6c859b1a0adb9ba2922a02e4461/lib/pundit.rb#L85) method could be:\r\n\r\n```ruby\r\n    def policy_scope(user, scope)\r\n      policy_scope = PolicyFinder.new(scope).scope\r\n    rescue ArgumentError\r\n      raise InvalidConstructorError, \"Invalid #<#{policy_scope}> constructor is called\"\r\n    else\r\n      policy_scope.new(user, pundit_model(scope)).resolve if policy_scope\r\n    end\r\n```\r\n\r\nor \r\n\r\n```ruby\r\n    def policy_scope(user, scope)\r\n      begin\r\n        policy_scope = PolicyFinder.new(scope).scope\r\n      rescue ArgumentError\r\n        raise InvalidConstructorError, \"Invalid #<#{policy_scope}> constructor is called\"\r\n      end\r\n\r\n      policy_scope.new(user, pundit_model(scope)).resolve if policy_scope\r\n    end\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Linuus","id":379823,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3OTgyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/379823?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linuus","html_url":"https://github.com/Linuus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linuus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linuus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linuus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linuus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Linuus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"h